-- Harley alt route (Mage first, any class). Merged from Harley Priest + Guidelime_Bethink "A-35-37_Desolace" (GPLv3).
Guidelime.registerGuide([[
[N 35-37 Desolace (Harley)]
[D Nijel's Point, Thunder Axe Fortress, the northern naga coast and southern hunting circuits. Prepares the Scarlet Monastery visit and ends in Southshore.]
[GA Alliance,Softcore]
[NX 37-38 Arathi Highlands (Harley)]
[A Mage] [O] Talents: From 36 to 39, spend points as the Questing Frost build lists them. The MageKit talent button (/mk talents) shows the next pick.
[A Mage] [OC] Rotation: Frostbolt to pull, Frost Nova, then shatter with Frostbolt or Ice Lance. A Fingers of Frost proc makes your next Ice Lance hit as if the target were frozen. Cone of Cold for packs; Cold Snap resets Frost Nova when a pull goes wrong. Ice Armor while questing, Mage Armor for long mana-heavy grinds.
[A Warlock] [O] Talents: At 36-37, Pandemic 2/3 and 3/3. The WarlockKit talent button (/wk talents) shows the next pick.
[A Warlock] [OC] Rotation: Bane of Agony, Corruption, Siphon Life when you have it, then Drain Life as the filler. Life Tap whenever health is full; wand only to finish. Curse of the Elements on long fights.
Start in Auberdine (or Darnassus) after the Thousand Needles journey. Keep Reclaimers' Business in Desolace, Brother Anton, Mythology of the Titans and the Southshore letters.
If you're in Darnassus, portal to Rut'theran and boat to Auberdine. Follow the road south into Ashenvale and east to Astranaar. [G34.41,48.00 Ashenvale] [P Astranaar]
[G49.48,67.09 Ashenvale] [LE Cooking 225-] [O] Follow the road southeast to Shandrina at Silverwind Refuge beside Mystral Lake. Buy and use Expert Cookbook (125 Cooking); skip if not ready.
Follow the road southwest to the Talondeep Path; traverse its tunnel into Stonetalon. Keep clear of Sun Rock Retreat and follow the western mountain road south to Desolace. [G42.59,71.58 Ashenvale]
[G64.66,10.54 Desolace] [P Nijel's Point] Take the eastern ramp into Nijel's Point before visiting its quest givers.
Accept [QA1437].
Accept [QA1387].
Turn in [QT1453], then accept [QA1458] and [QA1454].
Turn in [QT6141], then accept [QA261].
[G66.27,6.55 Desolace] [S Nijel's Point] Bind with Lyshaerya for the fortress and coast returns.
[V] Repair and restock. Keep space for the Reclaimers' reagents.
Collect ten Hatefury Claws and ten Horns in Sargeron for [QC1458]. Avoid Prince Kellen's group.
Follow the northern road west to the abandoned wagon and search its chest, then turn in [QT1437].
Accept [QA1465].
Return to Nijel's Point. Turn in [QT1465], then accept [QA1438].
Turn in [QT1458], then accept [QA1459].
Follow the northern road west to Ethel Rethor, then accept [QA5741].
Descend by the beach path and search Karnitol's Chest by the wreck, then turn in [QT1454].
Accept [QA1455].
[XP35] Reach level 35 before Thunder Axe Fortress.
[A Priest] [O] Talent points: Improved Power Word: Shield 1/3 at 36, Penance at 37.
[G54.86,26.13 Desolace] Reach Thunder Axe Fortress's gate and form a party for Dalinda's rescue and the fortress objectives.
Find Dalinda in the northern building. Turn in [QT1438], then accept [QA1439].
Clear the separate southern building, kill Tyranis and loot his pendant for [QC1439].
Climb the fortress tower's stairs; kill the Burning Blade Seer and loot the Sceptre of Light for [QC5741].
Return to Dalinda after clearing the escort exit. Let everyone who needs the escort turn in [QT1439], then confirm that the party is ready before anyone starts it.
Once everyone has turned in and confirmed they're ready, accept [QA1440].
Escort Dalinda out of Thunder Axe Fortress for [QC1440]; stay with her through the gate ambush.
Hearth to Nijel's Point if ready; otherwise take the northern road and eastern ramp. [H Nijel's Point] [O]
Turn in [QT1455], then accept [QA1456].
Turn in [QT1440].
Accept [QA5501].
[G69.35,42.54 Desolace] Collect fifteen Centaur Ears from Kolkar in the eastern valley for [QC1387].
[G64.12,57.68 Desolace] Collect seven Scorpashi Venom from Lashers along the central plain for the Reclaimers; avoid Venomlashes.
[G52.61,57.46 Desolace] Collect three Aged Kodo Hides from Aged Kodos for [QC1459]. Keep away from the higher-level bulls.
Accept [QA5561].
[G51.14,60.02 Desolace] Use the Kodo Kombobulator on one Aged, Dying or Ancient Kodo at a time. Lead it to Smeed and speak to it there; repeat until five have been delivered for [QC5561].
Turn in [QT5561].
Accept [QA6134].
Follow the central road north and the western road to Ethel Rethor. Turn in [QT5741], then accept [QA6027].
[G34.36,8.07 Desolace] Reach the northern shore and form a party for Karnitol's Satchel and the northern island statue.
With the party, collect Karnitol's Satchel from Slitherblade Sea Witches and Tidehunters on the northern coast for [QC1456].
Travel together to the northern island. Use the Gem of the Serpent at the Serpent Statue, defeat Lord Kragaru and loot the Book of the Ancients for [QC6027].
Turn in [QT6027].
[H Nijel's Point] [O] Hearth to Nijel's Point if ready; otherwise take the northern road and eastern ramp.
Turn in [QT1459] and [QT1456], then accept [QA1466]. Accept [QA1457]; keep the satchel delivery for Ironforge.
Turn in [QT1387].
[XP36] Reach level 36 before the southern group circuit. If short, hunt isolated level 35-36 centaurs on the central plains.
At the Kodo Graveyard, form a party for the bone collection. Collect ten Kodo Bones for [QC5501]; clear space before each pickup and defeat the summoned apparitions together.
At Mannoroc Coven, form a party and collect ten Felhound Brains from Mana Eaters, Mage Hunters and Ley Hunters for [QC1466,1].
Collect ten Nether Wings from Nether Maidens, Sisters and Sorceresses with the party for [QC1466,2].
Collect ten Doomwarder Blood from Doomwarder Captains with the party for [QC1466,3]. Avoid Lord Azrethoc and the stronger demon camps.
At the Valley of Bones approach, form a party for the spectres and Ravagers; place the Crate of Ghost Magnets, step back and kill the attracted spectres and collect eight Ghost-o-plasms for [QC6134]. Keep the crate.
Kill thirty Undead Ravagers with the party on the valley's outer slopes for [QC261]. The spectres do not count toward this hunt.
Turn in [QT6134].
Turn in [QT5501].
Hearth to Nijel's Point if ready; otherwise return by the central road and eastern ramp. [H Nijel's Point] [O]
Turn in [QT261], then accept [QA1052].
Turn in [QT1466], then accept [QA1467].
Fly to Astranaar, travel north to Auberdine and take the Menethil ship. Fly to Ironforge for the Reclaimers' deliveries.
Turn in [QT1457] and [QT1467].
Fly to Southshore. [G55.50,47.75 Ironforge] [F Southshore]
Turn in [QT1052], then accept [QA1053]; keep this quest active through the Library, Armory and Cathedral visits.
[G51.17,58.93 Hillsbrad Foothills] [S Southshore] Bind for the Scarlet Monastery return.
Travel west into Silverpine, then north by the main road. Pass The Sepulcher without entering and skirt the Undercity ruins and Brill; avoid their guards.
[G84.80,32.40 Tirisfal Glades] Reach Scarlet Monastery's entrance vestibule.
Join a five-player party with a tank and healer for the Graveyard clear.
Enter the left-hand Graveyard portal together.
Clear the Graveyard through Interrogator Vishas and Bloodmage Thalnos, then return to the vestibule.
[A Priest,Mage,Warlock] [O] If the rare Azshir the Sleepless is up in the Graveyard, kill him with the party; he can drop the Necrotic Wand (requires 30).
[A Warlock] [O] Scarlet Monastery Need-rolls: Bloodmage Mantle and Orb of the Forgotten Seer (Thalnos, requires 30 and 32), then in the Library Hypnotic Blade or Illusionary Rod (Doan, requires 34: +44 spell damage) and Mantle of Doan.
At the right-hand Library portal, join a five-player party with a tank and healer. Defeat Houndmaster Loksey for In the Name of the Light, then clear through Arcanist Doan.
Defeat Houndmaster Loksey for [QC1053,4]. Keep the other three bosses for the later visit. [O]
Collect Mythology of the Titans from the bookshelf in the Library's final rooms for [QC1050].
After defeating Doan, take The Scarlet Key from his strongbox. Keep it for the Armory and Cathedral.
Hearth to Southshore if ready; otherwise return through Tirisfal and Silverpine by the same approach. [H Southshore] [O]
Fly to Ironforge for the book delivery and training. [G49.34,52.27 Hillsbrad Foothills] [F Ironforge]
Turn in [QT1050].
[A Priest] [G24.73,8.16 Ironforge] [T] At High Priest Rohan, learn Devouring Plague III, Power Word: Fortitude IV and Power Word: Shield VI (1g each).
[A Priest] [G24.73,8.16 Ironforge] [T] [O] If gold allows, also learn Dispel Magic II, Holy Fire IV and Mind Soothe II (1g each). They can wait.
[G50.08,7.45 Ironforge] [T] [A Warlock] Train Shadow Bolt VI, Life Tap IV, Health Funnel IV, Create Firestone II and Create Spellstone. At Jubahl (52.70,6.08), buy and use Voidwalker Suffering II.
[A Warlock] [O] Short on gold? Create Firestone II and Health Funnel IV can wait until the next visit.
[A Warlock] [O] Felhunter: turn in [QT1758] to Krom Stoutarm in the Hall of Explorers, then accept [QA1802].
[A Warlock] [O] For [QC1802], take the Moldy Tome in western Hillsbrad and the Tattered Manuscript in Thousand Needles when you pass them. [L27.80,72.80 Hillsbrad Foothills] [L43.40,32.70 Thousand Needles]
[A Warrior] [G70.34,90.65 Ironforge] [T] At Kelv Sternhammer, learn Mocking Blow III and Whirlwind.
[A Shaman] [G47.14,13.52 Ironforge] [T] At Eldrun Stormbreaker, learn Ancestral Spirit III, Earth Shock V, Flametongue Weapon IV, Lesser Healing Wave III, Magma Totem II, Mana Spring Totem II and Windwall Totem I.
[A Rogue] [G51.96,14.84 Ironforge] [T] At Hulfdan Blackbeard, learn Backstab V, Expose Armor III and Rupture III.
[A Rogue] [G51.96,14.84 Ironforge] [T] At Hulfdan Blackbeard, learn Instant Poison III (160 Poisons). Learn recipes as your Poisons skill allows; skip unavailable recipes.
[A Paladin] [G23.13,6.14 Ironforge] [T] At Brandur Ironhammer, learn Holy Strike V, Redemption III, Exorcism III, Fire Resistance Aura I and Retribution Aura III.
[A Mage] [G27.25,8.30 Ironforge] [T] At Bink, learn Fireball VII and Blizzard III.
[A Hunter] [G70.89,83.61 Ironforge] [T] At Olmin Burningbeard, learn Aimed Shot III, Arcane Shot V, Immolation Trap III, Mend Pet IV and Viper Sting I.
[A Hunter] [G70.86,85.83 Ironforge] [T] At Belia Thundergranite, learn Great Stamina VI, Natural Armor VI. Open Beast Training and teach the usable ranks to your active pet as its level and training points allow.
[A Druid] Take the Deeprun Tram to Stormwind for Druid training.
[A Druid] [G35.84,67.38 Stormwind City] [T] At Sheldras Moontree, learn Frenzied Regeneration, Pounce I, Regrowth V, Revive III and Rip III.
[A Druid] Take the Deeprun Tram back to Ironforge before continuing.
[V] Repair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions.
Fly to Southshore. [G55.50,47.75 Ironforge] [F Southshore]
Finish in Southshore with Further Mysteries, Hints of a New Plague, In the Name of the Light and The Scarlet Key.
]], "Harley Mage")
